# uploads/
# --------
# This directory stores image files uploaded by users when reporting items.
# Files are served statically at: GET /uploads/<filename>
#
# Structure (managed automatically by uploadMiddleware):
#   uploads/
#     1691234567890-photo.jpg
#     1691234600000-item.png
#     ...
#
# Git ignores all file contents in this directory (see root .gitignore).
# This .gitkeep ensures the empty directory is tracked by Git so that
# multer's disk storage can write files here on first upload.
